<node id="&quot;EXISTING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Existing Credit Agreement refers to the original agreement dated September 1, 2022, which is subsequently amended by Amendment No. 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal contract detailing the terms and conditions of a credit agreement prior to amendments being made."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the legal contract outlining terms which is affected by the execution and delivery of the Amendment."&lt;SEP&gt;"those provisions of the Existing Credit Agreement that expressly survive termination thereof, which shall survive."</data>
